the strain you're under.

366
00:39:10.750 --> 00:39:13.050
There's no shame in
admitting that you need help.

367
00:39:15.654 --> 00:39:17.555
You mean "assistance."

368
00:39:17.557 --> 00:39:21.625
Nica. I am worried
about your heart. Okay?

369
00:39:23.795 --> 00:39:25.896
