paranoid accusations.

473
00:53:10.556 --> 00:53:11.955
Oh. that's right.
Tune me out.

474
00:53:11.957 --> 00:53:13.757
Let Barb take
care of everything.

475
00:53:13.759 --> 00:53:14.925
That's what you
always do anyway. right?

476
00:53:16.427 --> 00:53:17.894
You latte-making loser.

477
00:53:24.335 --> 00:53:26.503
What's the word
